  "prefLabel": "Pda 710.02 Types of Fees",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Pda 710.02 Types of Fees. The following types of fees shall be set by the schedule of fees determined under Pda 710.01:\n\n(a) Annual state-owned restricted pier slip permit fee; and\n\n(b) Single-use state-owned restricted pier slip permit fee.\n\nSource. #8846, EXEMPT, eff 3-21-07; ss by #14376, EXEMPT, eff 9-20-25",
